---
title: UML Sequence Diagram — Pelapor Mengirim Keluhan & Analisis AI
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Pelapor
  participant UI as Aplikasi Web (React)
  participant API as API Worker (Hono)
  participant RS as ReportService
  participant AS as AnalysisService
  participant R2 as Penyimpanan Foto (R2)
  participant DB as Database (D1)
  participant LLM as LLM Teks (DeepSeek)

  M->>UI: Pindai QR lokasi /report/<id> (atau pilih gedung & lantai/halaman)
  UI->>API: GET /api/cleaning/areas
  API->>DB: SELECT cleaning_areas
  DB-->>API: daftar lokasi aktif (cache 5 menit)
  API-->>UI: daftar lokasi
  M->>UI: Tulis keluhan + ambil foto kamera
  UI->>API: POST /api/uploads?kind=report (foto kondisi)
  API->>R2: simpan foto
  R2-->>API: photo_key
  API-->>UI: photo_key
  UI->>API: POST /api/reports {area_id, description, photo_key}
  API->>RS: submitReport()
  RS->>DB: cek lokasi aktif & keluhan kembar
  alt keluhan kembar
    RS-->>API: ID keluhan lama
  else keluhan baru
    RS->>DB: INSERT reports (status=new, ai_status=pending)
    RS->>DB: INSERT activity_log (report_created)
    RS-->>API: ID keluhan baru
  end
  API-->>UI: 201 {id, location, duplicate}
  UI-->>M: Tampilkan ID & halaman status

  Note over API,LLM: Setelah respons terkirim (ctx.waitUntil), berjalan asinkron
  API-)AS: runAnalysis(id)
  AS->>DB: ambil teks keluhan + nama lokasi
  AS->>LLM: analyzeComplaint(teks, lokasi)
  alt LLM berhasil
    LLM-->>AS: kategori, prioritas, ringkasan, rekomendasi
    AS->>DB: UPDATE reports (ai_status=ok, ...)
    AS->>DB: INSERT activity_log (analysis)
  else LLM gagal / timeout
    AS->>DB: UPDATE reports (ai_status=failed, ai_error)
    AS->>DB: INSERT activity_log (analysis_failed)
  end
